 "name_en": "Asset-Backed Securities Management (6B5)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Asset-Backed Securities Management (6B5)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc3257ae97d304d2984558a1833ce6b24\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc3257ae97d304d2984558a1833ce6b24__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The scope item helps you to manage asset-backed securities investments. The functionality helps you to automate labor-intensive processes, such as payment handling and accounting postings, giving you more time to focus on value-added activities. You can manage operational and accounting requirements.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The current scope covers the asset-backed securities (ABS), such as mortgage-backed securities (MBS), collateralized debt obligation (CDO) and nonmortgage ABS.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc3257ae97d304d2984558a1833ce6b24__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loioc3257ae97d304d2984558a1833ce6b24__ul_gk2_qsc_hxb\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create security account</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create security class</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create financial transactions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process payments</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post to General Ledger</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform period-end closing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform installment repayment</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor and report on class positions and financial transactions</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc3257ae97d304d2984558a1833ce6b24__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loioc3257ae97d304d2984558a1833ce6b24__ul_hk2_qsc_hxb\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Review the financial status</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate the management of asset-backed securities investments, including creation of security account, security class and financial transaction, payments, installment repayment and accounting</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Make better operational and strategic decisions using the comprehensive reporting and analysis tools</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve internal operational compliance</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase your focus on value-added activities instead of on manual procedures</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>资产担保证券管理 (6B5)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc3257ae97d304d2984558a1833ce6b24\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc3257ae97d304d2984558a1833ce6b24__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">该范围项目可帮助您管理资产担保证券投资。此功能可帮助您自动化劳动密集型流程（例如付款处理和会计过账），从而有更多时间专注于增值活动。您可以管理运营和会计要求。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">当前范围涵盖资产担保证券 (ABS)，例如抵押担保证券 (MBS)、抵押债务义务 (CDO) 和非抵押 ABS。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc3257ae97d304d2984558a1833ce6b24__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loioc3257ae97d304d2984558a1833ce6b24__ul_gk2_qsc_hxb\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建证券账户</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建证券类</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建金融交易</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理付款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账到总账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行期末关账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行分期还款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控和报告类头寸和金融交易</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc3257ae97d304d2984558a1833ce6b24__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loioc3257ae97d304d2984558a1833ce6b24__ul_hk2_qsc_hxb\">\n       <li class=\"li\">检查财务状况</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动管理资产担保证券投资，包括创建证券账户、证券类和金融交易、付款、分期还款和会计核算</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用全面的报表和分析工具，制定更明智的运营和战略决策</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高内部运营合规性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">增加您对增值活动的关注，而不是手动程序</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
